The ReAct Prompt Structure
Instead of asking an LLM to just answer a question, you give it a strict set of rules for how to behave. You force the LLM to output its response in a specific format:
Thought: The AI explains what it needs to do next.
Action: The AI requests to run a specific tool (function) with specific parameters.
PAUSE: The AI stops generating text.
Observation: Your Python script runs the requested tool, takes the output, and feeds it back to the AI.
